  13:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** *   @version M4_VERSION
  14:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** *   @brief   This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  15:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** *            of the Speed & Position Feedback component of the Stellar Motor Control.
  16:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** *
  17:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** *   @details This file provides firmware functions that implement the features
  18:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** *            of the Speed & Position Feedback component of the Stellar Motor Control.
