  25:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** /** @addtogroup STELLAR_PMSM_MC_FOC_LIBRARY
  26:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @{
  27:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   */
  28:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** 
  29:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** /** @defgroup SpeednPosFdbk Speed & Position Feedback
  30:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****  *
  31:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @brief Speed & Position Feedback components of the Stellar Motor Control
  32:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *
  33:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * These components provide the speed and the angular position of the rotor of a motor (both
  34:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * electrical and mechanical).
  35:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *
  36:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * Several implementations of the Speed and Position Feedback feature are provided by the Motor
  37:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * to account for the specificities of the motor used on the application:
  38:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *
  39:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * - @ref hall_speed_pos_fdbk "Hall Speed & Position Feedback" for motors with Hall effect sensors
  40:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * - @ref Encoder  "Encoder Speed & Position Feedback" for motors with a quadrature encoder
  41:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * - two general purpose sensorless implementations are provided:
  42:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *   @ref SpeednPosFdbk_STO "State Observer with PLL" and
  43:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *   @ref STO_CORDIC_SpeednPosFdbk "State Observer with CORDIC"
  44:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * - "High Frequency Injection" for anisotropic I-PMSM motors (Not included in this release).
  45:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *
  46:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @{
  47:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   */
  48:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** 
