  50:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @brief  It returns the last computed rotor electrical angle, expressed in
  51:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *         s16degrees. 1 s16degree = 360ï¿½/65536
  52:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @param  pHandle: handler of the current instance of the SpeednPosFdbk component
  53:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @retval int16_t rotor electrical angle (s16degrees)
  54:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   */
  55:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** #if defined (MCTK_ITCM)
