  64:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c **** /**
  65:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @brief  It returns the last computed rotor mechanical angle, expressed in
  66:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *         s16degrees. Mechanical angle frame is based on parameter bElToMecRatio
  67:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *         and, if occasionally provided - through function SPD_SetMecAngle -
  68:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *         of a measured mechanical angle, on information computed thereof.
  69:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @note   both Hall sensor and Sensor-less do not implement either
  70:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   *         mechanical angle computation or acceleration computation.
  71:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @param  pHandle: handler of the current instance of the SpeednPosFdbk component
  72:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   * @retval int16_t rotor mechanical angle (s16degrees)
  73:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/speed_pos_fdbk.c ****   */
